1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,739
Remy is a visitor from far away.

3
00:00:07,739 --> 00:00:10,797
He wants to see Maya's drawing.

4
00:00:10,797 --> 00:00:13,457
He gets lost on the path.

5
00:00:13,457 --> 00:00:16,396
Then he arrives so slow.

6
00:00:16,396 --> 00:00:17,992
Oh no!

7
00:00:17,992 --> 00:00:20,611
Mapi is the town map.

8
00:00:20,611 --> 00:00:23,045
She is a signpost.

9
00:00:23,045 --> 00:00:26,037
She points him to the right house.

10
00:00:26,037 --> 00:00:28,537
Zip is the fast road.

11
00:00:28,537 --> 00:00:32,553
A copy of the drawing waits at the edge of town.

12
00:00:32,553 --> 00:00:35,837
Remy does not walk all the way in.

13
00:00:35,837 --> 00:00:38,164
He gets it right there.

14
00:00:38,164 --> 00:00:40,837
Boost is the rocket path.

15
00:00:40,837 --> 00:00:43,005
One front door.

16
00:00:43,005 --> 00:00:47,739
Always the fastest road, no matter where he starts.

17
00:00:47,739 --> 00:00:50,611
Remy smiles at the drawing.

18
00:00:50,611 --> 00:00:53,364
Now you know the front door!

19
00:00:53,364 --> 00:00:58,058
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

